    "raw": "Day 2 - \nBeamed down on this strange planet to find myself surrounded by some of the weirdest foilage -- tree-like plant structures that have big round glowing skyblue bulbs on them, small little flowers that glow with light. I also keep hearing distant sounds, rustling of weeds, but I can't see more than a few feet in front of me, even with a flashlight. I think I'm going to start digging down into the ground, maybe board the exit off behind me. I don't want to get pulled into the jungle by some nasty beast or something.",
    "value": "第二日 -\n传送到这个奇怪的星球后，我发现自己被怪异的植被包围 - 树状结构的植物上挂着硕大的圆形天蓝色发光球体，还有随光线绽放的细小发光花朵。远处不断传来声响，杂草沙沙作响，可即便打着手电，能见度也不足几英尺。我打算开始往地下挖掘，或许该把身后的出口封住，免得被什么凶恶的野兽拖进丛林里去。"
